hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"214","Abu Musa told us, Muhammad bin Ja’far told us, Shu’bah told us, on the authority of Abdullah bin Dinar, he said: I heard Ibn Umar, saying: Umar asked The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, impurity afflicts me at night, so what should I do? He said: “Wash your penis and perform ablution, then lie down.”"
